{"ID":"20240314091737-5bwnlq1","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314091737-5bwnlq1","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314091737-5bwnlq1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171543-1annw41\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171543-t2hlat6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171543-t2hlat6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:71,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:71\u0026#125;","title":"【胶姜汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422171543"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422171543-1annw41","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422171543-1annw41","updated":"20240422171543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"妇人陷经漏下，黑不解，胶姜汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171543-6am8isi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171543-6am8isi","updated":"20240422171543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个呢，胶姜汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171543-g6p638c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171543-g6p638c","updated":"20240422171543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"妇人陷经漏下，黑不解"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"你知道他讲的是什么？讲的就是女人的血崩"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这个太太呢，生完小孩，可能呢胎盘没有完全清出来，留在肚子里面、留在子宫里面太久了，血崩下来，或者是一些外伤或者是怎么样，反正造成大量的出血，没有办法止住，这就是胶姜汤证，这就叫做"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"陷经漏下"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那这是比较危险了。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171543-uu0ol6z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171543-uu0ol6z","updated":"20240422171543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那过去呢这个处方呢没有了，那有人认为这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"胶艾汤加干姜，这是对的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这个胶姜汤既然顾名思义叫胶姜，我们过去就常常会把艾草拿掉，为什么要把艾草拿掉？"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"因为胶姜汤的目的是补血、止血，艾草艾叶呢专门进入血脉神经"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以当我们在止血、补血的时候，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"艾叶可能会增加血的出量，所以会把艾叶拿掉，把它换成干姜"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171543-t2hlat6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171543-t2hlat6","updated":"20240422171543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个是崩漏的时候用的，那这个处方呢，诸位回头看，用胶艾汤就可以了，把那个艾叶换成干姜，干姜就代表里面，因为我们认为里面是寒的，才会造成这样子。"}]}]}